    <style>
    :root {
      --blue:#4c83c3;
      --blue2:#245f9f;
      --yellow:#fdba12;
      --red:#b22c1b;
      --ink:#12233a;
      --muted:#5d6b7d;
      --paper:#fff;
      --wash:#f4f8fc;
      --line:#dbe5ef;
      --shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(35,74,113,.12)
    }
    * {
      box-sizing:border-box
    }
    html {
      scroll-behavior:smooth
    }
    body {
      margin:0;
      background:var(--paper);
      color:var(--ink);
      font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
      line-height:1.6
    }
    a {
      color:inherit
    }
    a:focus-visible,
    button:focus-visible,
    summary:focus-visible {
      outline:3px solid var(--yellow);
      outline-offset:3px
    }
    .skip-link {
      position:fixed;
      top:10px;
      left:12px;
      z-index:2000;
      padding:10px 14px;
      border-radius:9px;
      background:var(--blue2);
      color:#fff;
      font-weight:850;
      text-decoration:none;
      transform:translateY(-150%)
    }
    .skip-link:focus {
      transform:translateY(0)
    }
    img {
      max-width:100%;
      display:block
    }
    .wrap {
      width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 36px));
      margin:auto
    }
    .topline {
      height:6px;
      background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue) 0 58%,var(--yellow) 58% 79%,var(--red) 79%)
    }
    nav {
      position:sticky;
      top:0;
      z-index:50;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
      backdrop-filter:blur(16px)
    }
    .navin {
      min-height:92px;
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:24px
    }
    .brand {
      text-decoration:none;
      font-weight:900;
      letter-spacing:-.03em;
      font-size:1.18rem;
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:11px
    }
    .brand-logo {
      width: 160px;
      height: auto;
      max-height: 70px;
      object-fit: contain;
    }
    .nav-balloon {
      display:block;
      width:65px;
      height:65px;
      flex:0 0 65px;
      object-fit:contain
    }
    .brand b {
      color:var(--blue)
    }
    .brand i {
      color:var(--red);
      font-style:normal
    }
    .links {
      margin-left:auto;
      display:flex;
      gap:4px;
      align-items:center
    }
    .links a {
      text-decoration:none;
      padding:9px 11px;
      border-radius:9px;
      color:#36485f;
      font-weight:700;
      font-size:.83rem
    }
    .links a:hover {
      background:var(--wash);
      color:var(--blue2)
    }
    .links .facebook-nav {
      background:#1877f2;
      color:#fff
    }
    .links .facebook-nav:hover {
      background:#0f5fc5;
      color:#fff
    }
    .links .previous-year-nav {
      border:1px solid var(--yellow);
      color:var(--blue2)
    }
    .links .previous-year-nav:hover {
      background:#fff7dc;
      color:var(--blue2)
    }
    .menu {
      display:none;
      margin-left:auto;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      background:#fff;
      border-radius:10px;
      padding:9px 12px;
      font-weight:800
    }
    .hero {
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
      padding:0 0 76px;
      background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(6,31,60,.97) 0%,rgba(7,43,80,.88) 38%,rgba(7,43,80,.18) 72%),url("assets/images/hero-sketch-2026.png");
      background-size:cover;
      background-position:center
    }
    .hero:before {
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      inset:0;
      background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(3,20,39,.28),transparent);
      pointer-events:none
    }
    .hero .wrap {
      position:relative;
      z-index:1
    }
    .hero h1 {
      color:#fff;
      max-width:760px
    }
    .hero h1 span {
      color:#ffd14d
    }
    .hero .lead {
      color:#e2eef9;
      max-width:650px
    }
    .hero .eyebrow {
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.35);
      color:#fff;
      backdrop-filter:blur(8px)
    }
    .hero-logo {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: none;
      height: auto;
      object-fit: contain;
      object-position: left center;
      margin: 0 0 24px;
      padding: 0;
      border-radius: 0;
      background: transparent;
      box-shadow: none;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, .28));
    }
    .eyebrow {
      display:inline-flex;
      gap:9px;
      align-items:center;
      border:1px solid #bed5eb;
      border-radius:999px;
      padding:7px 12px;
      background:#fff;
      color:var(--blue2);
      font-size:.76rem;
      font-weight:900;
      letter-spacing:.1em;
      text-transform:uppercase
    }
    .eyebrow:before {
      content:"";
      width:8px;
      height:8px;
      background:var(--red);
      border-radius:50%
    }
    h1 {
      font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,6.1rem);
      line-height:.96;
      letter-spacing:-.065em;
      margin:24px 0 22px;
      max-width:900px
    }
    h1 span {
      color:var(--blue)
    }
    .lead {
      font-size:clamp(1.05rem,2vw,1.28rem);
      color:var(--muted);
      max-width:760px
    }
    .actions {
      display:flex;
      gap:12px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      margin-top:30px
    }
    .btn {
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      padding:13px 19px;
      border-radius:10px;
      text-decoration:none;
      font-weight:850;
      border:1px solid var(--red);
      background:var(--red);
      color:#fff
    }
    .btn.alt {
      background:#fff;
      color:var(--blue2);
      border-color:#bdcfe1
    }
    .reveal {
      margin-top:54px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.97);
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:22px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      overflow:hidden
    }
    .reveal-head {
      padding:18px 22px;
      background:var(--red);
      color:#fff;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:15px;
      align-items:center
    }
    .reveal-head strong {
      font-size:1.1rem
    }
    .reveal-head span {
      font-size:.78rem;
      font-weight:850;
      letter-spacing:.1em;
      text-transform:uppercase
    }
    .cities {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)
    }
    .city {
      padding:26px;
      text-align: center;
      border-right:1px solid var(--line)
          }
    .city:last-child {
      border:0
    }
    .city small {
      font-weight:900;
      color:var(--red);
      letter-spacing:.08em;
      text-transform:uppercase
    }
    .centre-number {
  display: block;
  margin: 5px 0 8px;
  color: var(--red);
  font-size: 2.2rem;
  font-weight: 900;
  line-height: 1;
}
    .city h3 {
      font-size:1.45rem;
      margin:5px 0
    }
    .city p {
      margin:0;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.92rem
    }
    .usp {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
      gap:15px;
      margin-top:18px
    }
    .usp div {
      padding:17px 18px;
      border-radius:15px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.95);
      border:1px solid #d6e6f5;
      font-weight:800;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .usp b {
      display:block;
      color:var(--blue2);
      font-size:1.05rem
    }
    section {
      padding:78px 0
    }
    .wash {
      background:var(--wash)
    }
    .kicker {
      font-size:.75rem;
      color:var(--red);
      font-weight:900;
      letter-spacing:.13em;
      text-transform:uppercase
    }
    .title {
      font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.15rem);
      line-height:1.08;
      letter-spacing:-.045em;
      margin:9px 0 16px
    }
    .intro {
      color:var(--muted);
      max-width:760px;
      font-size:1.05rem
    }
    .grid2 {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;
      gap:48px;
      align-items:start
    }
    .card {
      background:#fff;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:18px;
      padding:25px;
      box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(35,74,113,.06)
    }
    .card h3 {
      margin-top:0
    }
    .facts {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
      gap:12px
    }
    .formation {
      margin-top:24px;
      padding:22px 24px;
      border:2px solid var(--blue);
      border-radius:16px;
      background:#f6faff
    }
    .formation h3 {
      margin:0 0 8px;
      color:var(--blue2)
    }
    .formation-rule-points {
      display:flex;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      gap:8px;
      align-items:center;
      margin-top:12px
    }
    .formation-rule-points span {
      padding:7px 11px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:#eaf3fd;
      color:var(--blue2);
      font-size:.86rem;
      font-weight:800
    }
    .clarity {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1.35fr;
      gap:20px;
      align-items:stretch;
      margin-top:32px
    }
    .clarity-group {
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:18px;
      background:#fff;
      padding:22px
    }
    .clarity-label {
      font-size:.72rem;
      font-weight:900;
      letter-spacing:.12em;
      text-transform:uppercase;
      color:var(--red)
    }
    .clarity-group h3 {
      margin:5px 0 14px
    }
    .site-pills {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 8px;
  width: 100%;
}
    .site-pill {
  display: block;
  padding: 9px 6px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: #edf5fc;
  color: var(--blue2);
  font-size: clamp(.65rem, 1.2vw, .82rem);
  font-weight: 800;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
    .site-pill.focus {
      background:var(--blue);
      color:#fff
    }
    .clarity-arrow {
      align-self:center;
      font-size:1.8rem;
      color:var(--red);
      font-weight:900
    }
    .centre-list {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
      gap:8px
    }
    .centre-mini {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 10px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: #fff8e5;
  font-weight: 850;
  font-size: .82rem;
}
.centre-mini-number {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  align-self: stretch;
  min-height: 48px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: var(--blue);
  color: white;
  font-size: 1.45rem;
  font-weight: 900;
}

.centre-mini-text {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
    .centre-mini small {
      display:block;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-weight:650
    }
    .fact {
      padding:18px;
      border-left:4px solid var(--yellow);
      background:#fff;
      border-radius:10px
    }
    .fact b {
      display:block;
      color:var(--blue2)
    }
    .journey-flow {
      margin-top:36px
    }
    .journey-main {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
      gap:38px;
      counter-reset:journey-step
    }
    .journey-step {
      position:relative;
      display:flex;
      min-height:155px;
      padding:28px 24px 24px;
      flex-direction:column;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-top:5px solid var(--blue);
      border-radius:20px;
      background:#fff;
      text-align:center;
      box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(35,74,113,.08)
    }
    .journey-step:before {
      counter-increment:journey-step;
      content:counter(journey-step);
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      width:42px;
      height:42px;
      margin-bottom:14px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:var(--blue);
      color:#fff;
      font-size:1.05rem;
      font-weight:900;
      box-shadow:0 0 0 7px #eef6ff
    }
    .journey-step:not(:last-child):after {
      content:"\2192";
      position:absolute;
      top:50%;
      right:-31px;
      z-index:2;
      color:var(--red);
      font-size:1.55rem;
      font-weight:900;
      transform:translateY(-50%)
    }
    .journey-step h3 {
      max-width:300px;
      margin:0;
      color:var(--ink);
      font-size:1.02rem;
      line-height:1.42
    }
    .route-heading {
      margin:38px 0 28px;
      text-align:center
    }
    .route-heading span {
      display:inline-block;
      padding:7px 14px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:#eaf3fd;
      color:var(--red);
      font-size:.76rem;
      font-weight:900;
      letter-spacing:.08em;
      text-transform:uppercase
    }
    .route-heading h3 {
      margin:8px 0 0;
      color:var(--blue2);
      font-size:1.4rem
    }
    .qualification-routes {
      position:relative;
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));
      gap:34px;
      width:min(850px,100%);
      margin:auto
    }
    .qualification-routes:after {
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      right:25%;
      bottom:-27px;
      left:25%;
      height:3px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--yellow),var(--red),var(--blue))
    }
    .qualification-route {
      position:relative;
      min-height:168px;
      padding:25px;
      border-radius:20px;
      text-align:center;
      box-shadow:0 16px 38px rgba(35,74,113,.1)
    }
    .qualification-route:after {
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      bottom:-27px;
      left:50%;
      width:3px;
      height:27px;
      background:var(--blue);
      transform:translateX(-50%)
    }
    .qualification-route.direct:after {
      background:var(--yellow)
    }
    .qualification-route.direct {
      border:2px solid var(--yellow);
      background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff7df,#fff)
    }
    .qualification-route.asia-west {
      border:2px solid #8ebbe8;
      background:linear-gradient(145deg,#edf6ff,#fff)
    }
    .route-badge {
      display:inline-block;
      margin-bottom:12px;
      padding:6px 11px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:var(--red);
      color:#fff;
      font-size:.72rem;
      font-weight:900;
      letter-spacing:.07em;
      text-transform:uppercase
    }
    .asia-west .route-badge {
      background:var(--blue)
    }
    .qualification-route h3 {
      margin:0 0 8px;
      color:var(--blue2);
      font-size:1.2rem
    }
    .qualification-route p {
      margin:0;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.92rem
    }
    .world-final-step {
      position:relative;
      width:min(520px,100%);
      margin:52px auto 0;
      padding:28px;
      border-radius:22px;
      background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--blue2),#123a68);
      color:#fff;
      text-align:center;
      box-shadow:0 20px 44px rgba(16,55,96,.24)
    }
    .world-final-step:before {
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      top:-52px;
      left:50%;
      width:3px;
      height:52px;
      background:linear-gradient(var(--yellow),var(--red));
      transform:translateX(-50%)
    }
    .world-final-icon {
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      width:48px;
      height:48px;
      margin:0 auto 10px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:var(--yellow);
      color:var(--blue2);
      font-size:1.35rem
    }
    .world-final-step span {
      color:#dbeeff;
      font-size:.75rem;
      font-weight:850;
      letter-spacing:.09em;
      text-transform:uppercase
    }
    .world-final-step h3 {
      margin:5px 0 0;
      color:#fff;
      font-size:1.55rem
    }
    .rule {
      margin-top:22px;
      padding:22px;
      border:2px solid var(--yellow);
      background:#fff9e8;
      border-radius:16px
    }
    .rule strong {
      color:var(--red)
    }
    .women-slots {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:170px 1fr;
      gap:24px;
      align-items:center;
      margin-top:30px;
      padding:20px;
      border:2px solid var(--yellow);
      border-radius:20px;
      background:linear-gradient(120deg,#fff9e8,#fff);
      box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(35,74,113,.08)
    }
    .women-slots img {
      width:170px;
      aspect-ratio:1;
      object-fit:cover;
      border-radius:16px
    }
    .women-slots-copy h3 {
      margin:4px 0 8px;
      color:var(--blue2);
      font-size:1.45rem;
      line-height:1.2
    }
    .women-slots-copy p {
      margin:0;
      color:var(--muted)
    }
    .slot-number {
      color:var(--red);
      font-size:1.15em
    }
    .selection-flow {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
      gap:30px;
      margin-top:24px
    }
    .selection-stage {
      position:relative;
      padding:20px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:16px;
      background:#fff;
      text-align:center;
      box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(35,74,113,.06)
    }
    .selection-stage:not(:last-child):after {
      content:"\2192";
      position:absolute;
      top:50%;
      right:-25px;
      width:20px;
      color:var(--red);
      font-size:1.45rem;
      font-weight:900;
      line-height:1;
      transform:translateY(-50%)
    }
    .selection-stage strong {
      display:block;
      color:var(--blue2);
      font-size:1.02rem
    }
    .selection-stage span {
      display:block;
      margin-top:5px;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.86rem
    }
    .dates {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
      gap:13px;
      margin-top:28px
    }
    .date {
      padding:18px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:14px;
      background:#fff
    }
    .date span {
      display:block;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.8rem;
      font-weight:750
    }
    .date b {
      display:block;
      margin-top:5px;
      color:var(--blue2)
    }
    .date.confirmed {
      border-color:#edc7c0;
      background:#fff8f6
    }
    .date.confirmed b {
      color:var(--red)
    }
    .reggrid,.faqgrid {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
      gap:16px;
      margin-top:30px
    }
    .note {
      padding:21px;
      border-radius:15px;
      border-left:5px solid var(--red);
      background:#fff
    }
    .note h3 {
      margin:0 0 8px
    }
    .note p {
      margin:0;
      color:var(--muted)
    }
    .more-info-btn {
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      position:relative;
      width:30px;
      height:30px;
      margin-left:6px;
      padding:0;
      border:1px solid var(--blue);
      border-radius:50%;
      background:#fff;
      color:var(--blue2);
      font:inherit;
      font-size:.82rem;
      font-weight:900;
      line-height:1;
      vertical-align:middle;
      cursor:pointer
    }
    .more-info-btn:after {
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      inset:-7px
    }
    .more-info-btn:hover,
    .more-info-btn:focus-visible {
      background:var(--blue);
      color:#fff
    }
    .instruction-modal[hidden] {
      display:none
    }
    .instruction-modal {
      position:fixed;
      inset:0;
      z-index:1000;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      padding:20px;
      background:rgba(5,24,44,.72)
    }
    .instruction-modal-panel {
      position:relative;
      width:min(720px,100%);
      max-height:85vh;
      overflow:auto;
      padding:30px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:20px;
      background:#fff;
      box-shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(4,28,54,.28)
    }
    .instruction-modal-panel h2 {
      margin:0 54px 8px 0;
      color:var(--ink);
      font-size:1.45rem;
      line-height:1.25
    }
    .instruction-modal-panel>p {
      margin:0 0 18px;
      color:var(--muted)
    }
    .instruction-modal-panel ol {
      margin:0;
      padding-left:24px;
      color:var(--muted)
    }
    .instruction-modal-panel li+li {
      margin-top:9px
    }
    .modal-close {
      position:absolute;
      top:16px;
      right:16px;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      width:44px;
      height:44px;
      padding:0;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:50%;
      background:#fff;
      color:var(--ink);
      font-size:1.45rem;
      line-height:1;
      cursor:pointer
    }
    .modal-close:hover,
    .modal-close:focus-visible {
      border-color:var(--red);
      color:var(--red)
    }
    body.modal-open {
      overflow:hidden
    }
    details {
      background:#fff;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:14px;
      padding:0 18px
    }
    details+details {
      margin-top:10px
    }
    summary {
      cursor:pointer;
      padding:17px 0;
      font-weight:850
    }
    details p {
      margin:0 0 18px;
      color:var(--muted)
    }
    .people {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
      gap:15px;
      margin-top:28px
    }
.person {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;

  min-height: 210px;
  padding: 22px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 15px;
  background: #fff;
  text-align: center;
}
    .person span {
      display:block;
      color:var(--red);
      font-size:.76rem;
      font-weight:900;
      text-transform:uppercase;
      letter-spacing:.08em
    }
    .person h3 {
      margin:5px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .person-name-list {
      width:100%;
      margin:7px 0 5px;
      padding:0;
      list-style:none;
      color:var(--ink);
      font-size:1.03rem;
      font-weight:800;
      line-height:1.35;
      text-align:center
    }
    .person-name-list li {
      padding:6px 4px
    }
    .person-name-list li+li {
      border-top:1px solid var(--line)
    }
    .patron-pair {
      width:100%;
      margin-top:7px
    }
    .patron-pair-item {
      padding:7px 4px
    }
    .patron-pair-item+.patron-pair-item {
      border-top:1px solid var(--line)
    }
    .patron-pair-item h3 {
      margin:0 0 2px
    }
    .person p {
      margin:0;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.9rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .gallery {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
      gap:10px;
      margin-top:26px
    }
    .gallery img {
      width:100%;
      height:240px;
      object-fit:cover;
      border-radius:13px
    }

    .gallery-group {
      margin-top: 34px;
    }
    .gallery-group h3 {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      color: var(--blue2);
      font-size: 1.15rem;
    }
    .gallery figure {
      position: relative;
      margin: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 13px;
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 9px 24px rgba(35, 74, 113, .10);
    }
    .gallery-zoom {
      display:block;
      width:100%;
      padding:0;
      border:0;
      background:transparent;
      cursor:zoom-in
    }
    .gallery-zoom:focus-visible {
      outline:4px solid var(--yellow);
      outline-offset:-4px
    }
    .gallery-zoom img {
      display:block;
      transition:transform .25s ease
    }
    .gallery-zoom:hover img,
    .gallery-zoom:focus-visible img {
      transform:scale(1.035)
    }
    .qr-lightbox-panel.gallery-lightbox-panel {
      width:min(1200px,calc(100vw - 28px));
      max-height:96vh;
      padding:16px;
      background:#081f37
    }
    .gallery-lightbox-panel h3 {
      margin:8px 54px 12px;
      color:#fff
    }
    .qr-lightbox-panel.gallery-lightbox-panel img {
      width:auto;
      max-width:100%;
      max-height:calc(96vh - 82px);
      border:0;
      object-fit:contain
    }
    .gallery figure img {
      transition: transform .35s ease;
    }
    .gallery figure:hover img {
      transform: scale(1.035);
    }
    .gallery figcaption {
      position: absolute;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      padding: 24px 12px 10px;
      color: #fff;
      background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(5, 24, 44, .84));
      font-size: .78rem;
      font-weight: 750;
    }
    .partners {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
      gap:16px;
      margin-top:28px
    }
    .partner {
      min-height:155px;
      display:flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      text-align:center;
      padding:20px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:16px;
      background:#fff;
      text-decoration:none
    }
    .partner img {
      max-height:60px;
      max-width:210px;
      object-fit:contain;
      margin-bottom:12px
    }
    .partner.codechef strong {
      font-size:1.7rem;
      color:#5b3a29
    }
    .partner small {
      color:var(--muted)
    }
    .timeline-dates {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
      gap:14px;
      margin-top:30px
    }
    .timeline-date {
      position:relative;
      padding:20px 20px 20px 24px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:15px;
      background:#fff;
      box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(35,74,113,.05)
    }
    .timeline-date:before {
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      left:0;
      top:0;
      bottom:0;
      width:5px;
      border-radius:15px 0 0 15px;
      background:var(--blue)
    }
    .timeline-date.fee:before {
      background:var(--yellow)
    }
    .timeline-date.contest:before {
      background:var(--red)
    }
    .timeline-date span {
      display:block;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.79rem;
      font-weight:800;
      text-transform:uppercase;
      letter-spacing:.045em
    }
    .timeline-date b {
      display:block;
      margin-top:7px;
      color:var(--ink);
      font-size:1.05rem
    }
    .timeline-date small {
      display:block;
      margin-top:3px;
      color:var(--muted)
    }
    .fee-grid {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
      gap:14px;
      margin:26px 0
    }
    .fee-card {
      padding:22px;
      border-radius:16px;
      background:#fff;
      border:1px solid var(--line)
    }
    .fee-card strong {
      display:block;
      font-size:1.8rem;
      color:var(--blue2);
      line-height:1.1
    }
    .fee-card span {
      color:var(--muted);
      font-weight:750
    }
    .register-now {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1fr auto;
      gap:24px;
      align-items:center;
      margin:28px 0;
      padding:24px;
      border-radius:18px;
      color:#fff;
      background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--blue2),var(--blue));
      box-shadow:var(--shadow)
    }
    .register-now h3 {
      margin:0 0 5px;
      font-size:1.35rem
    }
    .register-now p {
      margin:0;
      color:#e8f3ff
    }
    .register-now-actions {
      display:flex;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      gap:10px;
      justify-content:flex-end
    }
    .payment-trigger {
      border-color:var(--yellow);
      background:var(--yellow);
      color:var(--blue2)
    }
    .payment-trigger:hover,
    .payment-trigger:focus-visible {
      border-color:#fff2c0;
      background:#fff2c0
    }
    .payment-progress {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));
      gap:10px;
      margin:22px 0
    }
    .payment-progress-step {
      position:relative;
      padding:15px 12px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:14px;
      background:#f7faff;
      text-align:center
    }
    .payment-progress-step b {
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      width:30px;
      height:30px;
      margin:0 auto 8px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:var(--blue);
      color:#fff
    }
    .payment-progress-step span {
      display:block;
      color:var(--ink);
      font-size:.84rem;
      font-weight:850;
      line-height:1.3
    }
    .payment-progress-link {
      border-color:var(--red);
      background:var(--red);
      text-decoration:none;
      box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(178,44,27,.18)
    }
    .payment-progress-link b {
      background:var(--yellow);
      color:var(--blue2)
    }
    .payment-progress-link span,
    .payment-progress-link small {
      color:#fff
    }
    .payment-progress-link small {
      display:block;
      margin-top:4px;
      font-size:.7rem;
      font-weight:800
    }
    .payment-progress-link:hover,
    .payment-progress-link:focus-visible {
      background:#941f14;
      transform:translateY(-2px)
    }
    .payment-submit-note {
      margin:0 0 20px;
      padding:12px 15px;
      border-left:4px solid var(--yellow);
      border-radius:10px;
      background:#fff8e5;
      color:var(--ink)
    }
    .payment-bank {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));
      gap:10px;
      margin:18px 0
    }
    .payment-bank div {
      padding:13px 14px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:12px;
      background:#fff
    }
    .payment-bank span {
      display:block;
      margin-bottom:3px;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.72rem;
      font-weight:850;
      letter-spacing:.05em;
      text-transform:uppercase
    }
    .payment-bank strong {
      display:block;
      color:var(--blue2);
      overflow-wrap:anywhere
    }
    .payment-methods {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 210px;
      gap:18px;
      align-items:start;
      margin-top:18px
    }
    .payment-methods h3 {
      margin:0 0 10px
    }
    .payment-methods .payment-bank {
      margin:0
    }
    .payment-qr {
      padding:14px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:16px;
      background:#f7faff;
      text-align:center
    }
    .payment-qr>strong {
      display:block;
      margin-bottom:9px;
      color:var(--blue2)
    }
    .payment-qr img {
      display:block;
      width:100%;
      max-width:180px;
      height:auto;
      margin:auto;
      border:1px solid #d7e1eb;
      border-radius:10px;
      background:#fff
    }
    .payment-qr-zoom {
      display:block;
      width:100%;
      padding:0;
      border:0;
      border-radius:10px;
      background:transparent;
      cursor:zoom-in
    }
    .payment-qr-zoom:focus-visible {
      outline:3px solid var(--yellow);
      outline-offset:4px
    }
    .payment-qr-hint {
      display:block;
      margin-top:7px;
      color:var(--blue2);
      font-size:.74rem;
      font-weight:850
    }
    .qr-lightbox[hidden] {
      display:none
    }
    .qr-lightbox {
      position:fixed;
      inset:0;
      z-index:1100;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      padding:18px;
      background:rgba(2,18,35,.9)
    }
    .qr-lightbox-panel {
      position:relative;
      width:min(440px,100%);
      max-height:94vh;
      padding:22px;
      overflow:auto;
      border-radius:18px;
      background:#fff;
      text-align:center;
      box-shadow:0 26px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.38)
    }
    .qr-lightbox-panel h3 {
      margin:0 48px 12px;
      color:var(--blue2)
    }
    .qr-lightbox-panel img {
      display:block;
      width:min(330px,100%);
      height:auto;
      margin:auto;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:12px
    }
    .qr-lightbox-panel p {
      margin:12px 0 0;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.88rem
    }
    .community {
      margin-top:24px;
      padding-top:18px;
      border-top:1px solid var(--line);
      text-align:center
    }
    .community h3 {
      margin:0 0 10px;
      font-size:.8rem;
      color:var(--muted);
      text-transform:uppercase;
      letter-spacing:.1em
    }
    .community-link {
      display:inline-flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      gap:3px;
      padding:9px 16px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:10px;
      background:#fff;
      text-align:center;
      text-decoration:none
    }
    .community-link img {
      width:auto;
      max-width:145px;
      max-height:44px;
      margin:0 0 4px;
      object-fit:contain
    }
    .community-link small {
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.78rem;
      line-height:1.3
    }
    .community-link strong {
      color:#5b3a29;
      font-size:1.15rem
    }
    .asiawest-band {
      padding:34px 0;
      background:#102b4d;
      color:#fff
    }
    .asiawest-in {
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:25px
    }
    .asiawest-in p {
      margin:4px 0 0;
      color:#cbdcec
    }
    .asiawest-in .btn {
      background:var(--yellow);
      border-color:var(--yellow);
      color:#3c2b00;
      white-space:nowrap
    }
    .contact {
      background:var(--blue);
      color:#fff
    }
    .contact .intro {
      color:#e8f2fb
    }
    .contactbox {
      margin-top:28px;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      align-items:center;
      gap:25px;
      padding:25px;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);
      border-radius:18px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.09)
    }
    footer {
      padding:30px 0;
      border-top:1px solid var(--line);
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.86rem
    }
    .foot {
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:20px;
      flex-wrap:wrap
    }
    .foot a {
      color:var(--blue2)
    }
    @media(max-width:960px) {
      .timeline-dates {
        grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)
      }
      .clarity {
        grid-template-columns:1fr
      }
      .clarity-arrow {
        transform:rotate(90deg);
        justify-self:center
      }
      .centre-list {
        grid-template-columns:1fr
      }
      .links {
        display:none;
        position:absolute;
        top:92px;
        left:0;
        right:0;
        background:#fff;
        padding:12px 18px;
        border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
        flex-direction:column;
        align-items:stretch
      }
      .links.open {
        display:flex
      }
      .menu {
        display:block
      }
      .cities,.usp,.people,.partners {
        grid-template-columns:1fr
      }
      .journey-main {
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
        gap:34px
      }
      .journey-step {
        min-height:130px
      }
      .journey-step:not(:last-child):after {
        content:"\2193";
        top:auto;
        right:50%;
        bottom:-29px;
        transform:translateX(50%)
      }
      .route-heading {
        margin-top:34px
      }
      .qualification-routes {
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
        gap:14px
      }
      .qualification-routes:after,
      .qualification-route:after {
        display:none
      }
      .qualification-route {
        min-height:0
      }
      .world-final-step {
        margin-top:42px
      }
      .world-final-step:before {
        top:-42px;
        height:42px
      }
      .city {
        border-right:0;
        border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)
      }
      .grid2 {
        grid-template-columns:1fr
      }
      .selection-flow {
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
        gap:12px
      }
      .selection-stage:not(:last-child):after {
        content:"\2193";
        top:auto;
        right:50%;
        bottom:-21px;
        width:auto;
        transform:translateX(50%)
      }
      .dates {
        grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)
      }
      .gallery {
        grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)
      }
    }
    @media(max-width:600px) {
      .timeline-dates,.fee-grid {
        grid-template-columns:1fr
      }
      .register-now {
        grid-template-columns:1fr
      }
      .register-now-actions {
        justify-content:flex-start
      }
      .asiawest-in {
        align-items:flex-start;
        flex-direction:column
      }
      .navin {
        min-height:76px
      }
      .links {
        top:76px
      }
      .brand-logo {
        width: 120px;
        height: auto;
        max-height: 58px;
      }
     .hero-logo {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: none;
        height: auto;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }
      .nav-balloon {
        width:50px;
        height:50px;
        flex-basis:50px
      }
      .brand span {
        display:none
      }
      .hero {
        padding-top:0;
        background-color:#0a315b;
        background-size:100% auto;
        background-position:center top;
        background-repeat:no-repeat
      }
      .hero:after {
        content:"";
        position:absolute;
        inset:0;
        background:rgba(4,28,54,.42)
      }
      .hero .wrap {
        z-index:2
      }
      section {
        padding:58px 0
      }
      .dates,.reggrid,.faqgrid,.facts {
        grid-template-columns:1fr
      }
      .gallery img {
        height:170px
      }
      .contactbox {
        align-items:flex-start;
        flex-direction:column
      }
      body {
        overflow-x:hidden
      }
      .wrap {
        width:calc(100% - 28px)
      }
      .menu {
        min-width:44px;
        min-height:44px
      }
      .links a {
        padding:12px
      }
      h1 {
        font-size:clamp(2.35rem,12vw,3.4rem);
        line-height:1;
        letter-spacing:-.05em
      }
      .hero {
        padding-bottom:52px
      }
      .hero-logo {
        margin-bottom:12px
      }
      .eyebrow {
        line-height:1.3
      }
      .actions {
        display:grid;
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
        gap:10px;
        margin-top:24px
      }
      .btn {
        width:100%;
        min-height:46px;
        padding:11px 15px;
        text-align:center
      }
      .reveal {
        margin-top:38px;
        border-radius:16px
      }
      .reveal-head {
        align-items:flex-start;
        flex-direction:column;
        gap:4px;
        padding:15px 17px
      }
      .city,.card,.clarity-group,.formation,.rule,.note,.register-now,.contactbox {
        padding:18px
      }
      .site-pill {
        white-space:normal;
        line-height:1.25
      }
      .site-pills {
        grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))
      }
      .women-slots {
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
        gap:14px;
        padding:18px;
        text-align:center
      }
      .women-slots img {
        width:130px;
        margin:auto
      }
      .people {
        gap:10px;
        margin-top:20px
      }
      .person {
        min-height:0;
        padding:15px 16px;
        align-items:flex-start;
        text-align:left
      }
      .person span,.person h3,.person p {
        text-align:left
      }
      .person-name-list {
        text-align:left
      }
      .person span {
        font-size:.68rem;
        line-height:1.35;
        letter-spacing:.055em
      }
      .person h3 {
        margin:4px 0 2px;
        font-size:1.05rem;
        line-height:1.35
      }
      .person p {
        font-size:.84rem;
        line-height:1.45
      }
      .partners {
        grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)) !important;
        gap:10px
      }
      .partner {
        min-height:120px;
        padding:12px
      }
      .partner img {
        max-width:100%;
        max-height:48px
      }
      .gallery {
        gap:8px
      }
      .gallery img {
        height:145px
      }
      .contactbox .btn {
        align-self:stretch
      }
      .instruction-modal {
        padding:12px
      }
      .instruction-modal-panel {
        max-height:90vh;
        padding:24px 18px 20px;
        border-radius:16px
      }
      .instruction-modal-panel h2 {
        margin-right:48px;
        font-size:1.2rem
      }
      .payment-progress,
      .payment-bank,
      .payment-methods {
        grid-template-columns:1fr
      }
      .payment-progress {
        gap:8px
      }
      .payment-progress-step {
        display:grid;
        grid-template-columns:34px 1fr;
        gap:10px;
        align-items:center;
        padding:11px 12px;
        text-align:left
      }
      .payment-progress-step b {
        margin:0
      }
      .payment-progress-link small {
        grid-column:2;
        margin-top:-7px
      }
      .payment-qr {
        width:min(240px,100%);
        margin:auto
      }
      .qr-lightbox {
        padding:10px
      }
      .qr-lightbox-panel {
        padding:18px 14px
      }
      .qr-lightbox-panel.gallery-lightbox-panel {
        width:calc(100vw - 20px);
        max-height:96vh;
        padding:10px
      }
      .gallery-lightbox-panel h3 {
        margin:8px 50px 10px 6px;
        font-size:1rem;
        text-align:left
      }
      .foot {
        flex-direction:column;
        gap:10px
      }
      section {
        scroll-margin-top:76px
      }
    }
  </style>
  </head>
  <body>
<div id="icpc-archive-banner">Archived copy of <a href="http://kanpur.indiaicpc.in/Kanpur_Ranklist.pdf">http://kanpur.indiaicpc.in/Kanpur_Ranklist.pdf</a> (fetched 2026-09-01) 
part of the <a href="https://icpc-contest-archive.github.io/contests/">ICPC contest archive</a>
(<a href="https://icpc-contest-archive.github.io/contests/contest/kanpur-2019.html">kanpur-2019</a>)  <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/*/http://kanpur.indiaicpc.in/Kanpur_Ranklist.pdf">wayback</a></div>

    <a class="skip-link" href="#about">Skip to main content</a>
    <div class="topline"></div>
    <!-- ===== SITE NAVIGATION ===== -->
    <nav>
      <div class="wrap navin">
        <a class="brand" href="#home">
          <img
            class="nav-balloon"
            src="assets/images/ICPC_Baloon.png"
            alt=""
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
          <span>
            <b>ICPC</b> Kanpur <i>2026</i>
          </span>
        </a>
        <button class="menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="links">Menu</button>
        <div class="links" id="links">
          <a href="#about">About</a>
          <a href="#structure">Contest Structure</a>
          <a href="#dates">Dates</a>
          <a href="#registration">Registration</a>
          <a href="#selection">Selection</a>
          <a href="#people">Team</a>
          <a href="#faq">FAQs</a>
          <a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
          <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
          <a class="previous-year-nav" href="https://kanpur.indiaicpc.in/2025/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ICPC 2025 &#8599;</a>
          <a class="facebook-nav" href="https://www.facebook.com/icpckolkan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Visit ICPC Kanpur Multi-Site on Facebook">Facebook &#8599;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <!-- ===== HERO / MAIN ANNOUNCEMENT ===== -->
    <header class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="wrap">
        <img class="hero-logo" src="assets/images/ICPCLogo.png" alt="ICPC Asia West Kanpur Mulit-Site">
        <div class="eyebrow">India's Oldest ICPC Regional Site</div>
        <h1>Kanpur Regional is now <span>bigger and closer.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="lead">After a very long time, the ICPC Kanpur Regional is going Multi-Site again in 2026! The onsite contest will be conducted across three centres—Kanpur, Gandhinagar, and Pune—creating more onsite opportunities and reducing travel for teams across India.</p>
        
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="reveal-head">
            <strong>ICPC Kanpur Multi-Site — now with more onsite slots and closer to you</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="cities">
            <article class="city">
              <small>Kanpur Regional onsite centre</small>
<span class="centre-number">01</span>
              <h3>Kanpur</h3>
              <p>
                <a href="https://csjmu.ac.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CSJM University, Kanpur ↗</a>
              </p>
            </article>
            <article class="city">
               <small>Kanpur Regional onsite centre</small>
<span class="centre-number">02</span>
              <h3>Gandhinagar</h3>
              <p>
                <a href="https://iitgn.ac.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IIT Gandhinagar ↗</a>
              </p>
            </article>
            <article class="city">
              <small>Kanpur Regional onsite centre</small>
<span class="centre-number">03</span>
              <h3>Pune</h3>
              <p>
                <a href="https://www.iiitp.ac.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IIIT Pune ↗</a>
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="usp">
          <div>
            <b>More onsite slots</b>More teams get the regional experience.</div>
          <div>
            <b>Less travel time</b>Choose a centre nearer to your region.</div>
          <div>
            <b>One Kanpur Regional</b>A shared contest experience across three cities.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>
    <!-- ===== ABOUT ICPC + TEAM FORMATION ===== -->
    <section id="about" tabindex="-1">
      <div class="wrap grid2">
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">About the contest</div>
          <p class="intro">The world&rsquo;s premier programming competition for university students, progressing from regional contests toward Asia West and the ICPC World Finals. <button class="more-info-btn" type="button" data-modal-target="about-icpc-modal" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="about-icpc-modal" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More information about ICPC" title="More Info">i</button></p>
          <p><strong>ICPC Kanpur is India’s oldest regional site</strong>, carrying forward a proud legacy of collegiate programming competition. In 2026, <strong>CSJM University, Kanpur will host the event for the ninth consecutive time</strong>. The onsite round will be held on <strong>22–23 December 2026</strong> at three centres.</p>
          <div class="formation">
            <h3>Team formation rule</h3>
            <div class="formation-rule-points">
              <span>3 student contestants</span>
              <span>1 coach</span>
              <span>Same institution</span>
              <button class="more-info-btn" type="button" data-modal-target="team-formation-modal" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="team-formation-modal" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More information about team formation rules" title="More Info">i</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="facts">
          <div class="fact">
            <b>India’s oldest regional site</b>A pioneering ICPC regional site with a distinguished legacy.
          </div>
          <div class="fact">
            <b>Ninth consecutive hosting</b>CSJM University, Kanpur is hosting the event for the ninth time in a row.
          </div>
          <div class="fact">
            <b>Teams of maximum three</b>Students collaborate on one contest computer.</div>
          <div class="fact">
            <b>Online preliminary</b>Qualify before reaching the onsite round.</div>
          <div class="fact">
            <b>Regional onsite</b>Compete at an allotted Kanpur Regional centre.</div>
          <div class="fact">
            <b>Higher rounds</b>Advance toward Asia West and the World Finals.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- ===== CONTEST STRUCTURE ===== -->
    <section class="wash" id="structure">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="kicker">Contest structure</div>
        <h2 class="title">Your route from registration to the World Finals</h2>
        <p class="intro">Every team seeking to participate at an ICPC regional site in India must qualify through the common ICPC India Preliminary Online Round.</p>
       
        <div class="journey-flow">
          <div class="journey-main">
            <article class="journey-step">
              <h3>Register your team for ICPC Kanpur Preliminary Round 2026</h3>
            </article>
            <article class="journey-step">
              <h3>Participate in ICPC India Preliminary Online</h3>
            </article>
            <article class="journey-step">
              <h3>Qualify Preliminary round and Participate in Kanpur Multi-Site Regional onsite</h3>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="route-heading">
            <span>After the Kanpur Regional</span>
            <h3>Two routes to the World Finals</h3>
          </div>

          <div class="qualification-routes">
            <article class="qualification-route direct">
              <span class="route-badge">Direct qualification</span>
              <h3>Kanpur Regional Winner</h3>
              <p>Advances directly to the ICPC World Finals. Further few top performing teams will get chance to compete in ICPC Asia West Championship</p>
            </article>
            <article class="qualification-route asia-west">
              <span class="route-badge">Asia West qualification</span>
              <h3>Top-performing teams</h3>
              <p>Compete at the ICPC Asia West Championship, where top performers also advance to the World Finals.</p>
            </article>
          </div>

          <article class="world-final-step">
            <div class="world-final-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#9733;</div>
            <h3>ICPC World Finals 2027</h3>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="rule">
          <strong>One common qualification round for all four regional sites in India.</strong> Every team wishing to participate at Kanpur, Mathura, Chennai, or Amritapuri must qualify through the jointly conducted <strong>ICPC India Preliminary Online Round</strong>. A team may register for at most <strong>two regional sites</strong>. Registration and the preliminary-round fee payment must be completed separately for each selected site. <button class="more-info-btn" type="button" data-modal-target="regional-registration-modal" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="regional-registration-modal" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More information about the common preliminary round and regional registrations" title="More Info">i</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- ===== ABOUT AND CONTEST STRUCTURE INFORMATION MODALS ===== -->
    <div class="instruction-modal" id="about-icpc-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="about-icpc-modal-title" hidden>
      <div class="instruction-modal-panel" tabindex="-1">
        <button class="modal-close" type="button" aria-label="Close About ICPC information">&times;</button>
        <h2 id="about-icpc-modal-title">About ICPC</h2>
        <p>The International Collegiate Programming Contest is the world&rsquo;s premier programming competition for university students. Teams of three combine algorithmic thinking, teamwork, and speed as they progress from regional competition toward the Asia West Continental Championship and the ICPC World Finals.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="instruction-modal" id="team-formation-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="team-formation-modal-title" hidden>
      <div class="instruction-modal-panel" tabindex="-1">
        <button class="modal-close" type="button" aria-label="Close team formation information">&times;</button>
        <h2 id="team-formation-modal-title">Team formation rule</h2>
        <p>An ICPC team consists of <strong>three student contestants and one coach</strong>. All three contestants and the coach must belong to the <strong>same institution</strong>. Students may be from any eligible academic branch, subject to the official ICPC regional eligibility rules.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="instruction-modal" id="regional-registration-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="regional-registration-modal-title" hidden>
      <div class="instruction-modal-panel" tabindex="-1">
        <button class="modal-close" type="button" aria-label="Close regional registration information">&times;</button>
        <h2 id="regional-registration-modal-title">Common preliminary round and regional registrations</h2>
        <p>The <strong>ICPC India Preliminary Online Round</strong> is jointly conducted by the Kanpur, Mathura, Chennai, and Amritapuri regional sites as the common qualification contest. Every team wishing to participate at any of these sites must qualify through this round. A team may register for at most <strong>two regional sites</strong> and must complete the registration and preliminary-round fee payment separately for each selected site. Each regional site prepares its own selection result from the teams registered for that site.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- ===== IMPORTANT DATES ===== -->
    <section id="dates">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="kicker">Important dates</div>
        <h2 class="title">The road to ICPC Kanpur 2026</h2>
        <div class="timeline-dates">
          <div class="timeline-date">
            <span>Registration starts</span>
            <b>06 August 2026</b>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-date">
            <span>Registration closes</span>
            <b>15 September 2026</b>
            <small>05:00 PM IST</small>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-date fee">
            <span>Fee payment starts</span>
            <b>15 August 2026</b>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-date fee">
            <span>Fee payment closes</span>
            <b>16 September 2026</b>
            <small>05:00 PM IST</small>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-date contest">
            <span>ICPC India Preliminary Online Contest</span>
            <b>03 October 2026</b>
            <small>Contest time will be announced later</small>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-date contest">
            <span>Kanpur Multi-Site Onsite Contest</span>
            <b>22–23 December 2026</b>
            <small>Kanpur · Gandhinagar · Pune</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- ===== REGISTRATION + FEES ===== -->
    <section class="wash" id="registration">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="kicker">Registration</div>
        <h2 class="title">Registration and fee payment are open.</h2>
        <div class="register-now">
          <div>
            <h3>Complete your Kanpur Preliminary registration</h3>
            <p>Register the team at ICPC Global, pay <strong>&#8377;1,500 per team</strong>, then submit the transaction proof through the payment form.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="register-now-actions">
            <a class="btn" style="background:#fff;color:#245f9f;border-color:#fff" href="https://icpc.global/login?redirect_uri=/private/teamRegistration/site/40225" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Register team</a>
            <button class="btn payment-trigger" type="button" data-modal-target="payment-modal" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="payment-modal" aria-expanded="false">Pay registration fee</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="fee-grid">
          <div class="fee-card">
            <strong>₹ 1,500/-</strong>
            <span>per team · Preliminary Online Contest</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fee-card">
            <strong>₹ 4,500/-</strong>
            <span>per qualifying team · Kanpur onsite round</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reggrid">
          <article class="note">
            <h3>1. Form an eligible team</h3>
            <p>Form a team of three students and one coach from the same institution.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="note">
            <h3>2. ICPC Global &mdash; Team Registration by the Coach</h3>
            <p>The coach registers the team and all three students at the <strong>ICPC Kanpur Preliminary Site</strong>. <button class="more-info-btn" type="button" data-modal-target="step-2-modal" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="step-2-modal" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More information about team registration by the coach" title="More Info">i</button></p>
          </article>
          <article class="note">
            <h3>3. ICPC Global &mdash; Profile Completion by the Students</h3>
            <p>All three students complete their ICPC profiles using their invitation emails. <button class="more-info-btn" type="button" data-modal-target="step-3-modal" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="step-3-modal" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More information about profile completion by the students" title="More Info">i</button></p>
          </article>
          <article class="note">
            <h3>4. Pay the fee and submit documents</h3>
            <p>Pay the Kanpur Preliminary fee and submit the UTR, payment proof and required team documents. <button class="more-info-btn" type="button" data-modal-target="payment-modal" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="payment-modal" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Open fee payment instructions" title="Payment instructions">i</button></p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="rule">
          <strong>Choosing more than one regional site?</strong> Complete a separate registration and preliminary-round fee payment for each selected site. Maximum: two regional sites per team.</div>
        <p style="margin-top:24px">
        <a class="btn alt" href="https://icpc.global" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit ICPC Global</a>  
        <button class="btn" type="button" data-modal-target="payment-modal" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="payment-modal" aria-expanded="false">Pay registration fee</button>
          <a class="btn alt" href="https://icpc.global/regionals/rules" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read ICPC Regional Rules</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- ===== REGISTRATION INSTRUCTION MODALS ===== -->
    <div class="instruction-modal" id="step-2-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="step-2-modal-title" hidden>
      <div class="instruction-modal-panel" tabindex="-1">
        <button class="modal-close" type="button" aria-label="Close Step 2 instructions">&times;</button>
        <h2 id="step-2-modal-title">ICPC Global &mdash; Team Registration by the Coach</h2>
        <p>Follow these steps to register the proposed team through the coach&rsquo;s ICPC account.</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Log in using the coach&rsquo;s registered ICPC account.</li>
          <li>Find and select the ICPC Kanpur Preliminary Site for the current contest year.</li>
          <li>Open the contest page and select <strong>&ldquo;Register a Team.&rdquo;</strong></li>
          <li>Enter the proposed team name.</li>
          <li>Add all three students using their full names and active email addresses.</li>
          <li>Verify and submit the registration.</li>
          <li>The team remains incomplete or pending until all students complete their profiles.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="instruction-modal" id="step-3-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="step-3-modal-title" hidden>
      <div class="instruction-modal-panel" tabindex="-1">
        <button class="modal-close" type="button" aria-label="Close Step 3 instructions">&times;</button>
        <h2 id="step-3-modal-title">ICPC Global &mdash; Profile Completion by the Students</h2>
        <p>Each student must complete their own ICPC profile using the email address supplied by the coach.</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Open the invitation sent to the email entered by the coach.</li>
          <li>Log in or create an account using the same email address.</li>
          <li>Complete full name, contact details, gender, date of birth, institution, programme or degree, and expected graduation year.</li>
          <li>Provide any other information required by the ICPC portal.</li>
          <li>Accept the declarations, terms and participation agreements.</li>
          <li>Review and save the profile before the deadline.</li>
          <li>The coach must confirm that all profiles are complete and the team status shows successfully registered or complete.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="instruction-modal" id="payment-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="payment-modal-title" hidden>
      <div class="instruction-modal-panel" tabindex="-1">
        <button class="modal-close" type="button" aria-label="Close fee payment instructions">&times;</button>
        <div class="kicker">Kanpur Preliminary fee</div>
        <h2 id="payment-modal-title">Pay &#8377;1,500 and submit proof</h2>

        <div class="payment-progress" aria-label="Fee payment process">
          <div class="payment-progress-step">
            <b>1</b>
            <span>Pay the fee</span>
          </div>
          <div class="payment-progress-step">
            <b>2</b>
            <span>Save UTR &amp; proof</span>
          </div>
          <a class="payment-progress-step payment-progress-link" href="https://forms.gle/QhKh1htUs5acx4x56" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Submit payment details through the 2026 Google Form">
            <b>3</b>
            <span>Submit payment details</span>
            <small>Google Form &#8599;</small>
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="payment-submit-note"><strong>Required:</strong> Your team will be considered for the Kanpur Preliminary only after payment details and proof are submitted through the Google Form.</p>

        <div class="payment-methods">
          <div>
            <h3>Bank details</h3>
            <div class="payment-bank">
              <div>
                <span>Bank</span>
                <strong>State Bank of India</strong>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span>Account name</span>
                <strong>ICPC CSJMU</strong>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span>Account number</span>
                <strong>42362425849</strong>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span>IFSC code</span>
                <strong>SBIN0064085</strong>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span>Branch</span>
                <strong>CSJMU Branch, Kanpur</strong>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span>Amount</span>
                <strong>&#8377;1,500 per team</strong>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <aside class="payment-qr" aria-label="UPI payment QR code">
            <strong>Scan &amp; Pay with UPI</strong>
            <button class="payment-qr-zoom" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="qr-lightbox" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Enlarge the ICPC CSJMU UPI QR code">
              <img src="assets/images/qr.jpg" alt="SBI UPI QR code for ICPC CSJMU registration fee payment" width="184" height="300">
            </button>
            <span class="payment-qr-hint">Tap or click to enlarge</span>
          </aside>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="qr-lightbox" id="qr-lightbox" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="qr-lightbox-title" hidden>
      <div class="qr-lightbox-panel" tabindex="-1">
        <button class="modal-close qr-lightbox-close" type="button" aria-label="Close enlarged QR code">&times;</button>
        <h3 id="qr-lightbox-title">Scan &amp; Pay with UPI</h3>
        <img src="assets/images/qr.jpg" alt="Enlarged SBI UPI QR code for ICPC CSJMU registration fee payment" width="184" height="300">
        <p>Save the successful-payment screenshot and UTR.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- ===== TEAM SELECTION ===== -->
    <section id="selection">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="kicker">Team selection</div>
        <h2 class="title">Selection through the ICPC India Preliminary Round</h2>
        <p class="intro">Kanpur Regional selection is based on preliminary performance. <button class="more-info-btn" type="button" data-modal-target="team-selection-modal" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="team-selection-modal" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="More information about team selection" title="More Info">i</button></p>
        <div class="selection-flow" aria-label="Team selection pathway">
          <div class="selection-stage">
            <strong>India Preliminary Round</strong>
            <span>Compete in the common online contest</span>
          </div>
          <div class="selection-stage">
            <strong>Kanpur Multi-Site Ranking</strong>
            <span>Eligible registered teams are ranked</span>
          </div>
          <div class="selection-stage">
            <strong>Onsite Invitation</strong>
            <span>Selected teams receive centre details</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="women-slots">
        <img src="assets/images/all-female-team-cartoon.png" alt="Cartoon illustration of three female contestants collaborating at a computer" loading="lazy">
        <div class="women-slots-copy">
          <div class="kicker">Reserved onsite opportunity</div>
          <h3><span class="slot-number">5</span> reserved slots for all-female contestant teams</h3>
          <p><strong>Five onsite slots</strong> are reserved for teams with three female contestants. Kanpur Regional registration and preliminary-round participation are required.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="instruction-modal" id="team-selection-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="team-selection-modal-title" hidden>
      <div class="instruction-modal-panel" tabindex="-1">
        <button class="modal-close" type="button" aria-label="Close team selection information">&times;</button>
        <h2 id="team-selection-modal-title">From prelims to the Kanpur Regional onsite round</h2>
        <p>Kanpur Regional ranks eligible teams using their performance in the common preliminary round. Only teams registered for Kanpur Regional and completing all Kanpur registration formalities are considered for Kanpur Regional Multi-Site Onsite Contest selection.</p>
        <p>Selected teams receive an invitation to the Kanpur Regional onsite contest. Official communication identifies the assigned onsite centre&mdash;Kanpur, Gandhinagar, or Pune&mdash;and the steps required to confirm the slot.</p>
        <p>Teams must complete confirmation within the communicated timeline. Unconfirmed slots may be offered to eligible waitlisted teams.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
